### REST Client Test - Module Infrastruktur Aset & Segmen

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@authToken = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. GET List Tipe Infrastruktur (Active Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/infrastruktur
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2. GET GeoJSON Master Aset per Tipe
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/infrastruktur/jalan?format=geojson
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. GET Segmen per Parent Master Aset
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/infrastruktur/jalan/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/segmen
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. POST Create Segmen Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/infrastruktur/jalan/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/segmen
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "panjang": 500,
  "lebar": 3.5,
  "kondisi": "Baik",
  "status_kondisi": "Realisasi 100%",
  "tahun_pembangunan": 2024,
  "sumber_dana": "APBDes",
  "sumber_data": "Survey Desa",
  "status_aset": "Aset Desa"
}

### 5. GET All Area Polygon per Tipe (GeoJSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/infrastruktur/jalan/area?format=geojson
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. POST Create Area Polygon Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/infrastruktur/jalan/area
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "namobj": "Area Perkerasan Lahan Parkir / Tambatan",
